Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-c2346aa9b9ae6468END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-d086ad03b1ea0861END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_BaldursMouth_GortashPortraitProduction</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BaldursMouth_GortashPortraitProduction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BaldursMouth_GortashPortraitProduction\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">6f2a02ff-45b6-4a31-a1e7-be186cd6b844</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6f2a02ff-45b6-4a31-a1e7-be186cd6b844\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6f2a02ff-45b6-4a31-a1e7-be186cd6b844\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Baldur's Mouth</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1032&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1035</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[An unsent letter from Ettvard Needle, addressed to Lord Enver Gortash.]\n</p><p><br>\nFar be it, milord, for me to question a decree from you - but I worry you haven't the full picture in mind. If we were to stop <i>all</i> production of the Baldur's Mouth Gazette for even a tenday, our reach and audience impact would take a debilitating blow. <i>Yes</i>, I understand the portrait you'ved ordered we print is a <a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\">Fevras</a> original, <i>yes</i> I understand what it'll do for your image before Council next meets to discussion succession plans - but please, take a moment to consider what you're asking from me.\n</p><p>Yours faithfully\n</p><p>- Ettvard Needle, Editor in Chief, Baldur's Mouth Gazette\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In-game the name is mispelled as 'Regarding Portrait Producton' (missing an 'i')</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714225727\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1616/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32161/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9125/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930474/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.340      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   46.340      1 -total\n 52.27%   24.220      7 Template:Icon_text\n 46.85%   21.712     17 Template:Trim\n 21.59%   10.005      2 Template:Uid\n 19.11%    8.857      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.20%    5.652      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.98%    5.550      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.68%    4.948      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.53%    4.882      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31476-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714225727 and revision id 369497. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}